        'Refraction and lenses — Class 10 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on Refraction and Lenses to help you master the core concepts of optics for your Sindh Board examinations. Understanding how light bends is essential, especially when applying Snell''s Law $n_1 sin(i) = n_2 sin(r)$ and the lens formula $1/f = 1/p + 1/q$. Remember that mastering these principles, including the power formula $P = 1/f$, is the key to securing high marks in your physics paper, so keep practicing these derivations and numerical problems diligently.', 'Physics',
