        'Hydrocarbons and organic chemistry basics — Class 10 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum students, I have prepared these concise notes to help you master the fundamental concepts of organic chemistry and hydrocarbons for your upcoming Federal Board exams. Focus on understanding the homologous series and the general formulas like alkanes $C_nH_{2n+2}$, alkenes $C_nH_{2n}$, and alkynes $C_nH_{2n-2}$ to excel in your structural naming questions. Remember that the combustion of hydrocarbons is a vital reaction represented by the general equation $C_xH_y + (x + y/4)O_2 \rightarrow xCO_2 + (y/2)H_2O$. Practice these reactions diligently, and you will surely achieve excellent marks in your chemistry paper.', 'Chemistry',
