        'Heat and thermodynamics — Class 10 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have compiled these essential revision notes on Heat and Thermodynamics to ensure you are fully prepared for your Sindh Board examinations. It is crucial to grasp how thermal energy causes physical changes, particularly through the linear expansion formula $\Delta L = \alpha L_0 \Delta T$ and the heat transfer equation $Q = mc\Delta T$. Remember that these concepts form the backbone of thermal physics, and mastering the ideal gas law $PV = nRT$ will help you solve complex problems with ease. Keep practicing these derivations diligently to secure top marks in your physics paper.', 'Physics',
