      ) VALUES (
        'commons_anon_topic_06', 'commons_anon_topic_06-quadratic-equations-class-10-sindh-board', 'notes',
        'Quadratic equations — Class 10 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum students, today we are focusing on the vital topic of Quadratic Equations which is a cornerstone of your Class 10 Sindh Board Mathematics syllabus. This guide covers the standard form $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ and explores various methods like factorization and completing the square to find the roots. You must master the quadratic formula $x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$ to solve complex problems efficiently during your board exams. Additionally, we examine the nature of roots using the discriminant $D = b^2 - 4ac$ to predict if solutions are real or imaginary. Practice these notes diligently to secure excellent marks in your upcoming finals.', 'Mathematics',
