        'Human digestive system — Class 10 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum class, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on the Human Digestive System to help you ace your Federal Board exams. Understanding how our body processes nutrients is essential, especially when we look at chemical reactions like $$C6H12O6 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 6H2O + Energy$$ and the enzymatic breakdown of starch into maltose. Remember that digestion is a complex physiological process defined by $pH$ levels and enzyme specificity, so focus on the role of accessory organs. Let us dive into these concepts to ensure you are fully prepared for your upcoming assessments.', 'Biology',
