        'Photosynthesis and respiration — Class 10 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the vital processes of energy transformation in living organisms. Understanding how plants convert light into chemical energy using $$6CO2 + 12H2O -> C6H12O6 + 6O2 + 6H2O$$ and how cells release that energy through $C6H12O6 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 6H2O + ATP$ is essential for your Sindh Board examinations. Focus on the relationship between these two cycles, as they form the backbone of biological energetics in our syllabus.', 'Biology',
