        'Mole concept and stoichiometry — Class 9 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the Mole Concept and Stoichiometry, which are the heart of your Chemistry syllabus. Understanding how to relate mass to the number of particles using the Avogadro constant $N_A = 6.022 \times 10^{23}$ is essential for solving numerical problems. Remember that in any balanced chemical reaction, the relationship between reactants and products is governed by the law of conservation of mass, expressed as $n = \frac{mass}{molar mass}$. By practicing these calculations, you will gain the confidence to score full marks in your Sindh Board examinations.', 'Chemistry',
