        'Algorithms and flowcharts — Class 9 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the logic behind problem-solving in Computer Science. Understanding how to structure a process is essential, especially when we consider that a well-defined algorithm follows a finite sequence of steps, often represented as $Step_n = Step_{n-1} + 1$. By mastering these tools, you will be able to translate complex real-world problems into computational solutions, ensuring your logic remains as precise as the mathematical relation $$Input + Process = Output$$.', 'Computer Science',
