        'commons_anon_topic_41', 'commons_anon_topic_41-letter-and-application-writing-class-10-federal-board', 'notes',
        'Letter and application writing — Class 10 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the art of formal correspondence for your upcoming Federal Board examinations. Remember that a well-structured letter follows the logic of $Total Score = Content + Format + Expression$, and an application is governed by the principle of $Formal Tone = Respectful Language + Conciseness$. By focusing on the structural integrity of your writing, you ensure that your message is conveyed with professional clarity. Let us work together to achieve excellence by mastering these essential communication formulas: $$Structure = Heading + Salutation + Body + Subscription$$ and $$Clarity = Purpose + Precision + Politeness$$.', 'English',
