        'Newton''s laws of motion — Class 9 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students! I am delighted to share these comprehensive revision notes on Newton''s Laws of Motion, which are the very foundation of classical mechanics and a vital part of your Class 9 Physics syllabus. Mastering the relationship $F = ma$ and understanding how $a = F/m$ describes the behavior of objects will significantly boost your confidence for the Federal Board exams. We will also explore the interactive nature of forces where $F_{AB} = -F_{BA}$ to ensure you grasp every conceptual detail required for top marks.', 'Physics',
