        'Introduction to Python — Class 10 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the basics of Python programming for your Class 10 board exams. Python is a powerful language where we often use arithmetic operations like $a = b + c$ or logical comparisons such as $x > y$ to build our logic. Remember that a simple program structure follows the flow of $input -> process -> output$, and understanding these fundamentals is the key to scoring full marks in your practical and theory papers.', 'Computer Science',
