        'Biomolecules — Class 9 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on Biomolecules to help you master the building blocks of life for your Sindh Board exams. Understanding how carbon atoms form the backbone of life is essential, especially when you look at the general formula for carbohydrates $C_n(H_2O)_n$ or the basic structure of an amino acid $R-CH(NH_2)-COOH$. May these notes simplify your revision and help you achieve that top grade in your Biology paper as you master the concepts of $$E + S -> ES -> E + P$$.', 'Biology',
