        'Sets and functions — Class 9 (Sindh Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on Sets and Functions to help you master the fundamentals required for your Sindh Board examinations. Understanding the relationship between elements is crucial, especially when we define the Cartesian product as $A \times B = \{(a, b) | a \in A, b \in B\}$. Remember that a function is a special type of relation where every input has exactly one output, often expressed as $$f: A \to B$$. Practice these concepts diligently to ensure you can solve problems involving $A \cup B$ and $A \cap B$ with complete confidence.', 'Mathematics',
