        'Tenses with examples — Class 9 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on English Tenses to help you master the backbone of your grammar section for the Federal Board exams. Remember that understanding the structure of time is essential, just as we use logical patterns like $Subject + Verb + Object$ for simple sentences or the complex $Subject + has/have + V_{3rd}$ for perfect tenses. By practicing these rules, you will gain the confidence to express your ideas clearly and score full marks in your objective and subjective papers, ensuring you master concepts like $Tense = Time + Aspect$.', 'English',
