        'Cell structure and function — Class 9 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on Cell Structure and Function to help you master the fundamental building blocks of life for your upcoming Federal Board exams. Remember that understanding the relationship between structure and function is key, as seen in the surface area to volume ratio $SA:V$ and the cellular respiration equation $$C6H12O6 + 6O2 -> 6CO2 + 6H2O + ATP$$. Focus on these core concepts to ensure you can confidently draw and label diagrams, which is a significant portion of your biology paper.', 'Biology',
