        'Atomic structure — Class 9 (Federal Board)', 'Assalam-o-Alaikum dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes on Atomic Structure to help you ace your Federal Board exams with confidence. Understanding the building blocks of matter is essential, especially when mastering concepts like the mass number formula $A = Z + N$ or the shell capacity rule $$2n^2$$. Remember that the arrangement of electrons, governed by the energy level filling order $1s < 2s < 2p$, is the key to predicting chemical behavior. Let us dive into these concepts together and build a strong foundation for your future in science.', 'Chemistry',
